What is printed?
```
int add(int a, int b) {
    return a + b;
}
int main() {
    int s = 1;
    add(s, 5);
    printf("%d", s);
    return 0;
}
```

What is printed?
```
int i = 0, s = 0;
while (i < 5) {
    i++;
    if (i == 2)
        continue;
    s += i;
}
printf("%d", s);
```

